    "category": "conflict_visibility",
    "description": "当多个来源对同一业务规则存在冲突时，收敛结果必须保留待澄清或待决策对象，而非直接覆盖为单一约束。",
    "expected_invariants": [
      "open_clarification_or_decision_present",
      "no_silent_overwrite"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "eval_02_confirmation_gate",
    "name": "高风险对象状态升级必须经过显式确认门禁",
    "category": "governance_gate",
    "description": "未经用户确认的候选约束或交接物发布动作，必须被确定性验证器拦截。",
    "expected_invariants": [
      "unconfirmed_handoff_blocked"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "eval_03_source_traceability",
    "name": "已生效约束必须可回指来源证据",
    "category": "source_traceability",
